From 4f4bb650c92d21cb580192f7a288c48ce3b92113 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 15:09:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Floating chat bubble, name and email fields, honeypot,
 beforeOpen hook

- config.bubble adds a fixed chat bubble in any corner; the widget opens next to it
- Name and email inputs; hidden honeypot field; page URL sent with each submission
- config.beforeOpen can delay opening (used for a grown-up check on the kids site)
- Errors from the server are shown in the form instead of an alert; non-2xx counts as failure
- Escape closes the widget; init works when the script loads after page load
- Drop the Powered by Rowy link (no outside links on the kids site)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0151pDBqAnsdGZRRpNdEQAFE
